invalid type: string "PUSTAKA\n1. First Aid, responding to an emergency, Australian red\ncross, 1995\n2. First Aid manual, The Authorized Manual of St John\nAmbulance, St. Andrew’s Ambulance Association, and the\nBritish Red Cross, Dorling Kindersley, 2002\n3. Anestesiologi, Fakultas Kedokteran Universitas Indonesia,\nCV Info Medika, Jakarta 1989\n rasa sakit\n- Beri air minum sebanyak mungkin\n